data/background.jpg and res/background.jpg
===========================================

"City lights dot the Canadian landscape underneath an aurora"

Author:  NASA Johnson Space Center (ISS Expedition 72, iss072e725406)
Licence: Public domain - a work of the U.S. federal government, not
         subject to copyright (17 U.S.C. 105)
Source:  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:City_lights_dot_the_Canadian_landscape_underneath_an_aurora_(iss072e725406).jpg

Shipped copies are derived from the 8256x5504 original:

  data/background.jpg  2560x1707, q88, EXIF stripped - installed to
                       /usr/share/wmde-greeter/background.jpg and read at
                       startup, so it can be replaced without rebuilding.
  res/background.jpg   640x427, q80 - compiled into the binary by
                       src/common.rs as the last-resort fallback for the
                       case where the file above is missing.

Replacing the picture needs nothing but a new file at the installed path;
the licence of a replacement is the packager's responsibility.
